## 📋 Architectural Plan: Vendor Invoice Processing Flow

### 1. Summary

This flow fires automatically when a PDF lands in your SharePoint **New Vendor** folder. It downloads the file, runs it through the **InvoiceIXP** extraction model to pull structured fields, parses the key values into a clean payload, and posts the invoice directly to SAP via a BAPI/RFC call. Failures at any step route to an error-logging path so no invoice is silently lost.

---

### 2. Flow Diagram

```mermaid
graph LR
    trigger(New File in SharePoint)
    downloadFile[Download Invoice PDF]
    extractInvoice[Extract Invoice Fields]
    parseFields[Parse Invoice Fields]
    postToSap[Post Invoice to SAP BAPI]
    doneSuccess(Done)
    logDownloadErr[Log Download Error]
    logExtractErr[Log Extraction Error]
    logSapErr[Log SAP Post Error]
    doneErr(Done with Error)
    trigger -->|output| downloadFile
    downloadFile -->|output| extractInvoice
    downloadFile -->|error| logDownloadErr
    extractInvoice -->|success| parseFields
    extractInvoice -->|error| logExtractErr
    parseFields -->|success| postToSap
    postToSap -->|output| doneSuccess
    postToSap -->|error| logSapErr
    logDownloadErr -->|success| doneErr
    logExtractErr -->|success| doneErr
    logSapErr -->|success| doneErr
```

---

### 3. Node Table

| # | Node ID | Name | Category | Node Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `trigger` | New File in SharePoint | trigger | `uipath.connector.trigger.uipath-microsoft-onedrive.file-created` | Fires on any new file in the drive; Phase 2: filter to "New Vendor" folder path |
| 2 | `downloadFile` | Download Invoice PDF | connector | `uipath.connector.uipath-microsoft-onedrive.download-file` | Phase 2: bind SharePoint connection; input file ID from trigger output |
| 3 | `extractInvoice` | Extract Invoice Fields | ixp | `uipath.ixp.invoiceixp-cef0d447-ixp.ff973488-5d89-8035-86ac-f980b4be6deb-c4359cde-55f0-4f0e-9322-c6cdce74ab4c` | InvoiceIXP model (Shared); fileRef wired from download output |
| 4 | `parseFields` | Parse Invoice Fields | action | `core.action.script` | Jint script: reads `Fields[]` by FieldName; returns vendor, invoiceNumber, amount, date, currency |
| 5 | `postToSap` | Post Invoice to SAP BAPI | connector | `uipath.connector.uipath-sap-bapi.execute-bapi-rfc` | Phase 2: bind SAP connection; BAPI = `BAPI_INCOMINGINVOICE_CREATE`; **connection must be created first** — see Open Questions |
| 6 | `doneSuccess` | Done | control | `core.control.end` | Success terminal |
| 7 | `logDownloadErr` | Log Download Error | action | `core.action.script` | Returns `{ error: $vars.downloadFile.error.message }` |
| 8 | `logExtractErr` | Log Extraction Error | action | `core.action.script` | Returns `{ error: $vars.extractInvoice.error.message }` |
| 9 | `logSapErr` | Log SAP Post Error | action | `core.action.script` | Returns `{ error: $vars.postToSap.error.message }` |
| 10 | `doneErr` | Done with Error | control | `core.control.end` | Error terminal |

